From: EngineOS maintainers
Subject: Apply official upstream maintenance to the tmux 3.6b regress suite

The EngineOS matrix runs the upstream-authored tests without local exclusions.
These changes are copied from official tmux commits which correct stale or
racy expectations in the 3.6b release archive:

* 5c73d3878d4904bce3d61399fb6a222ed39a4dbc - combining-width result;
* dd62c2f9467f975388f4a2701022752961bdb086 - deterministic input-key setup;
* 6f588402c34471b0dea0c0894a2caca275f92f17 - remove a platform-dependent
  invalid Unicode result.

